From dadd1daaea7ecddb01a572805f5981714af30faa Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nuxel <nuxel@localhost>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 18:29:03 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/5] nuxel: classify end-session failures, add exit codes and
 presence check

flash now emits NUXEL_* result lines, returns a distinct exit code per failure
class, and (when a reboot was requested) refuses to treat a device that is
still in Download Mode as a completed flash. A missing end-session
acknowledgement is never success.
---
 heimdall/source/FlashAction.cpp  | 214 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 heimdall/source/NuxelExitCodes.h |  58 +++++++++
 2 files changed, 266 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 heimdall/source/NuxelExitCodes.h

